s expected:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mFixed! The \u001b[38;5;105madd_months\u001b[25G\u001b[39mfunction\u001b[34Gnow\u001b[38Gclamps\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gday\u001b[53Gto\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Glast\u001b[65Gvalid\u001b[71Gday\u001b[75Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gtarget\u001b[14Gmonth\u001b[20Gusing\u001b[26G\u001b[38;5;105mcalendar.monthrange()\u001b[39m.\u001b[49GThe\u001b[53Greported\u001b[62Gcase\u001b[67Gnow\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Greturns \u001b[38;5;105mdate(2024, 2, 29)\u001b[39m as expected, and it\u001b[49Galso handles o\u001b[64Gher e\u001b[70Gge\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcases like\u001b[14Gn\u001b[17G-leap years and months with fewer than 31 days.\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
